:'''Himeko:''' You recall correctly, but there was more to this invite.
:'''Himeko:''' "...Witness the impossible in the realm of dreams, find the Legacy of the Watchmaker, Father of Penacony, and thus the answer to the question: Why does life slumber."
:'''Welt:''' I don't remember that part of the invite... You mean, there was a hidden message?
:'''Himeko:''' This is the part that intrigues me &mdash; the invite sent by The Family was nothing more than a music box that, when wound, would play an accompanying tune.
:'''Himeko:''' But the box that was sent to us was slightly unusual... The music it played had off-key notes in the background.
:'''Himeko:''' I recorded these dissonant notes, and they were a perfect match with the gravity wave frequency when the Express made its warp jump. Also, the Express engine's spatial curvature was its encryption key.
:'''Welt:''' ...A distress call method regularly used by the Nameless.
:'''Himeko:''' I can't be certain. It may be a Masked Fool's trap. From the execution itself, the Riddlers or Inquisition Spirits could have done this themselves.
:'''Welt:''' When did you discover this?
:'''Himeko:''' When we were handling that Luofu Stellaron matter. I told Pom-Pom about it first thing.
:'''Welt:''' It's no wonder that IPC ambassador also mentioned this "Watchmaker." The invite he received must also have contained a hidden message, and it seems like he decoded it.
:'''Welt:''' ...There's something else on my mind. When the invite was brought up, that Family leader mentioned being one of the "actual administrators" of Penacony, and that it was their duty to "relieve" us of any problems.
:'''Welt:''' In hindsight, there was more to that statement. He also had Miss Robin with him... I'm no singer, but her voice sounded a little strange... Would a singer really take to the stage if their voice wasn't in top shape?
:'''Himeko:''' Are you saying... you suspect that The Family did not send the invite, and... is hiding something from us?
:'''Welt:''' It's possible. The fact that The Family sent out invites to the other factions is already unusual. And your discovery confirms that there could be a third party involved... I take back what I said: This "event" is becoming more interesting with each passing second.
:'''Welt:''' Why didn't you tell the others?
:'''Himeko:''' We shouldn't interfere if this is just an internal affair of Penacony or The Family.
:'''Welt:''' But you said so yourself: This could concern the Trailblaze.
:'''Himeko:''' Well, I did, which is why...
:'''Himeko:''' ...before we set off, I told March 7th and Dan Heng about this.
:'''Welt:''' So I was the only one kept in the dark then.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I too just found out about the invite thingy...
::'''March 7th:''' That's because you were zonked out the whole ride. No one had the chance to tell you.
