:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the Watchmaker...
::'''Himeko:''' One can't discuss the Planet of Festivities without mentioning the Watchmaker &mdash; Penacony's household name and figure. Fortune, fame, status... He built everyone's futures with his bare hands, and became the symbol of dreams.
