::'''Himeko:''' For now, I do not think this invite is linked to the Watchmaker. His legacy... It sounds more like a marketing hook to drum up more traffic, if nothing else.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About that IPC representative...
::'''Himeko:''' An IPC ambassador who knows more than he lets on, a silver-tongued businessman, a flamboyant and debonair aristocrat... He could be all of them. My instincts tell me he's much more than meets the eye.
::'''Himeko:''' Before the dust settles, we should maintain amicable relations with all camps, while keeping our guards up.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the dream journey...
::'''Himeko:''' The dream Penacony is divided into twelve individual dreamscapes. I've heard that the destinations vary for different people when they first enter the dream.
::'''Himeko:''' As for me... I look forward to the Moment of Scorchsand &mdash; its wild winds, taverns, and {{Rubi|festive choices|SoulGlad™ Festivity Auditions • Scorchsand Venue}} have more of a Nameless Trailblaze vibe. The Moment of Morning Dew is also a decent choice &mdash; I can use that chance to visit The Family.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} That's enough chit-chat for now.
::'''Himeko:''' You must be exhausted from everything that's happened so far. Even if you're Trailblazing, you mustn't forget to relax. Goodnight, and sweet dreams.

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:'''Welt:''' The decor in here's a little... loud for my tastes. So this is how astral high society does things, huh...?
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the Watchmaker...
::'''Welt:''' They say he's a historically important figure in Penacony, and tales of his life have been handed down over generations. Such tales encourage believers to come to the Planet of Festivities to pursue their dreams. He's an interesting fellow, that's for sure, and his legacy still has the power to draw people in.
::'''Welt:''' But how and why he's involved with that invite, and why his name popped up in the encrypted message allegedly sent by a Nameless... I've got no leads for now.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About The Family...
::'''Welt:''' The Family believes in the Harmony, and their altruism is well-known across the stars &mdash; a trait that is intimately tied to Penacony's stability and prosperity.
::'''Welt:''' But some factions have always been wary of The Family &mdash; suspecting that their benevolence and eloquence belie an ulterior motive... So far, it seems to me that The Family treats their guests with courtesy, so I don't think we need to worry about that for now.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the dream journey...
::'''Welt:''' The dream Penacony is divided into twelve moments. Personally, I'm interested in the Moment of Sol &mdash; it's a visual dreamscape steeped in Penacony's history and civilization.
::'''Welt:''' Penacony's Grand Museum, the Primal Waking Library, the Paperfold academy... The pasts that we chase may be stored in these places.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} That's enough chit-chat for now.
::'''Welt:''' Past the guest room's Dreampool is the real Penacony. Let's get ready to move out. Pleasant dreams.

